window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-003-98ff71fc71964399.json"]={sha256:"98ff71fc71964399d491d4cfb2976d5d9c4bfba0edb38003434f0e73ec9f0045",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-eefea3b644112566","url":"https://newsreleases.sandia.gov/releases/2006/asci-red-decom.html","title":"Sandia’s ASCI Red is decommissioned","titleEn":"Sandia’s ASCI Red is decommissioned","publisher":"Sandia National Laboratories","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-003","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-003","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-004","referenceUrls":["https://research.ibm.com/publications/overview-of-the-blue-genel-system-architecture"],"title":"Blue Gene/L：雙核心角色與虛擬節點取捨","titleEn":"Blue Gene/L: dual-core roles and virtual-node tradeoffs","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付階段時間分解、固定工作模型與擴展決策；38與23正確，並列1216與1472工作者毫秒，不宣稱真機實測；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver stage timing, fixed-work models and a scaling decision. Verify 38 and 23 with resource costs 1216 and 1472 worker-ms, explicitly excluding claims of machine measurement. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫兩核心的讀取、計算及等待區；把雙核心模式視為部署選項，不假設效能自動加倍；52、68、84與44門檻可重算，無重複或遺漏工作ID。","differenceEn":"Draw reads, computation and waits on both cores; treat modes as deployment choices rather than automatic doubling. Reproduce 52, 68, 84 and break-even 44 with no repeated or missing job IDs.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成每輪時間 T(P)=W/P+s，其中W是可分工作、s是串行準備；不代表實機拓樸；W=960毫秒、s=8毫秒，比較P=32與64，同一問題大小；名義式 960/32+8 = 38 ms/iteration；變更式 960/64+8 = 23 ms/iteration。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","教學方案A以兩核心分攤W並付同步h，T=W/2+h；方案B一核心計算、另一服務，T=W+c；固定W=80毫秒，方案A h=12；改h=28，資料及計算量不變。方案B c=4；名義式 80/2+12 = 52 ms；變更式 80/2+28 = 68 ms。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Teaching iteration time T(P)=W/P+s, where W is divisible work and s serial setup; it is not a machine-topology model. W=960 ms, s=8 ms, comparing 32 and 64 workers at fixed problem size. Nominal 960/32+8 = 38 ms/iteration; changed 960/64+8 = 23 ms/iteration. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Teaching option A splits W across two cores plus synchronization h; option B uses one compute core and one service core, T=W+c. W=80 ms, option A h=12 then 28 with identical data/work; option B c=4. Nominal 80/2+12 = 52 ms; changed 80/2+28 = 68 ms. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-013","referenceUrls":["https://docs.alcf.anl.gov/aurora/"],"title":"Aurora GPU Max：多裝置容量與分片預算","titleEn":"Aurora GPU Max: device capacity and shard budgets","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付階段時間分解、固定工作模型與擴展決策；38與23正確，並列1216與1472工作者毫秒，不宣稱真機實測；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver stage timing, fixed-work models and a scaling decision. Verify 38 and 23 with resource costs 1216 and 1472 worker-ms, explicitly excluding claims of machine measurement. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"列資料、暫存、函式庫保留三類，畫六個獨立容量框；每份陣列須有裝置歸屬；兩個元素數吻合，bytes/GiB一致且峰值存活集合未超可用容量。","differenceEn":"Separate data, scratch and library reserve in six capacity boxes, assigning each array to a device. Both counts match, bytes/GiB agree and peak live arrays fit usable capacity.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成每輪時間 T(P)=W/P+s，其中W是可分工作、s是串行準備；不代表實機拓樸；W=960毫秒、s=8毫秒，比較P=32與64，同一問題大小；名義式 960/32+8 = 38 ms/iteration；變更式 960/64+8 = 23 ms/iteration。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","單裝置可供陣列使用容量M−R，b bytes/元素時可放floor((M−R)/b)元素；不可直接加總跨裝置容量；合成每裝置64GiB、保留8GiB、FP64 b8；改保留16GiB，並非Aurora實際規格；名義式 (64-8)*2**30/8 = 7516192768 elements/device；變更式 (64-16)*2**30/8 = 6442450944 elements/device。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Teaching iteration time T(P)=W/P+s, where W is divisible work and s serial setup; it is not a machine-topology model. W=960 ms, s=8 ms, comparing 32 and 64 workers at fixed problem size. Nominal 960/32+8 = 38 ms/iteration; changed 960/64+8 = 23 ms/iteration. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","One device holds floor((M−R)/b) elements after reserve R; summing capacity does not remove partitioning requirements. Synthetic 64 GiB/device, reserve 8 GiB, FP64 b 8; compare reserve 16 GiB, not actual Aurora specifications. Nominal (64-8)*2**30/8 = 7516192768 elements/device; changed (64-16)*2**30/8 = 6442450944 elements/device. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-1e61fd473c64b4f3","url":"https://research.ibm.com/publications/overview-of-the-blue-genel-system-architecture","title":"Overview of the Blue Gene/L system architecture","titleEn":"Overview of the Blue Gene/L system architecture","publisher":"IBM Research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-38f4c5ed877c4c03","url":"https://docs.alcf.anl.gov/aurora/","title":"Aurora Machine Overview","titleEn":"Aurora Machine Overview","publisher":"Argonne Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
